\\lambda}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>前两式是 ZFC 中的基本基数算术律；它们不决定连续统函数或奇异基数处的全部指数运算。</li>\n<li>The behavior at singular cardinals is especially complex.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$、$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)$、$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)$，且 $\\omega\\leq\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu$（see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\leq\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\omega\\leq\\lambda\\Bigr)\\to\\bigl(\\kappa+\\lambda=\\max\\{\\kappa,\\lambda\\}\\land\\kappa\\cdot\\lambda=\\max\\{\\kappa,\\lambda\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\Bigr)\\to(\\kappa^\\lambda)^\\mu=\\kappa^{\\lambda\\cdot\\mu}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\